  "binding_note": "Each entry names its Figure and Ground roles. A path schema alone does not identify a motion: 'reach to a point' and 'hand it across' share the very same Path and differ only in what the Figure is located against. That is Talmy's decomposition taken literally, and it is why the retrieval key is schema plus roles rather than schema alone.",
